  "help": "Usage: rm [OPTION]... FILE...\n{{help:force:0}}\n  -i                      prompt for each removal using stdin\n  -I                      prompt once for recursion or more than three operands\n      --interactive[=WHEN] never, once or always (default with option)\n{{help:recursive:0}}\n                          reject symbolic links with trailing separators\n{{help:dir:0}}\n{{help:verbose:0}}\n{{help:preserve-root:0}}\n{{help:no-preserve-root:0}}\n{{help:help:0}}\n{{help:version:0}}\nOrdinary option/operand errors exit 1; documented capability refusals retain their own status.\n",
